        {
          "id": "volume4a-tail-037",
          "section": "7.2.1.4",
          "cnPdfPage": 352,
          "enPdfPages": [
            423
          ],
          "location": "M(5,14)的空序列边界",
          "original": "$L(4,0)$ 是空字符串",
          "final": "$L(4,0)$ 仅含一个空字符串",
          "basis": "L(5,−1)没有元素，L(4,0)是以空字符串为唯一元素的序列；因此554L(4,0)能贡献一个分划554，555L(5,−1)不贡献。保留两版例子的这一运算区别。",
          "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
          "pageMarkdownSha256": "c8aa700a7561be6437596461598e3d92127d85df6872c296ad79905f7916dc26",
          "cnPrintedPage": 337
        },
        {
